{"ID":"20240205153923-pfgrvna","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153923-pfgrvna","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153923-pfgrvna\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205172310-g5hlme3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611150404-f77rmp2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2370,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611150909-grxtb64\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:8,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:8\u0026#125;","title":"173白芷","type":"doc","updated":"20240913160215"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205172310-g5hlme3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205172310-g5hlme3","updated":"20240205172315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【產地】\t主產浙江、四川、黑龍江、吉林、遼寧等地。\n【性狀】\t根呈圓錐形，長1020cm，直徑22.5cm。表面灰棕色，有橫向突起的皮孔，頂端有凹陷的莖痕。質硬，斷面白色，粉性足，皮部密佈棕色油點。氣芳香，味辛、微苦。\n【性味】\t辛，溫。\n【功效】\t祛風濕，活血排膿，生肌止痛。用於頭痛、牙痛、鼻淵、腸風痔漏、赤白帶下、癰疽瘡瘍、皮膚瘙癢。\n【注解】\t“疙瘩丁”：指白芷藥材的外皮上所帶有的皮孔樣橫向突起。"}]},{"ID":"20240205172303-rt059q1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205172303-rt059q1","updated":"20240205172303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240205172303-6qcsdwu.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205154834-gmqopkx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205154834-gmqopkx","updated":"20240205154834"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白芷"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白芷-20240205154834-v4stjk5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"2